{
  "PlayerEvents.Perk.BasiliskResistanceDetail": "[pg](<b>Gained Perk: Basilisk Resistance - Your maximum speed is permanently decreased unless you are a basilisk, but you are now immune to the basilisk's gaze!</b>)[pg]"
  "PlayerEvents.Perk.BasiliskResistanceGained": "You notice that you feel a bit stiff and your skin is a bit harder. Something clicks in your mind as you finally unlock the potential to protect yourself from the goddamn basilisks!"
  "PlayerEvents.Perk.TransformationResistanceDetail": "[pg](<b>Gained Perk: Transformation Resistance - Transformative items now have less chance to transform you. In addition, any Bad Ends related to overdose of certain transformative items are now disabled. Resistance can be toggled on/off from the perk menu.</b>)[pg]"
  "PlayerEvents.Perk.TransformationResistanceGained": "You feel a strange tingling sensation. It seems as if you've finally adapted to the transformative properties of the food in Mareth and your body has finally built up enough resistance! You suspect that you can still transform but at somewhat diminished rate."
}
